            "description_html": "<b>Replacement LIFT-OFF Security Bar for 36 Inch Steel Exit Door Security Bar, ESI-SB-01-0036-LO</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA 1-1/4\" x 38-3/4\" 16 gauge square steel tubing LIFT-OFF security bar is for use with a <a href=\"/products/36-inch-outswing-door-security-door-bars-esi-sb-01-0036\">36 Inch Steel Exit Door Security Bar</a>. The heavy duty steel security bars are finished in gray powder coat epoxy baked to a semi-gloss. <!-- \"L\" bolts are 6-1/2\" long with zinc chromate finish. --> You can cut the bar to length. Meaning, if you need the bar to be 32\", you will cut down the 36\" bar.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Replacement Exit Security Bar Lift Off Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Length: 38-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Gauge: 16 Steel</li>\r\n<!-- <li>L Bolt Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) L bolts.</li> -->\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SB-01-0036.pdf?v=1704262219\" target=\"new\"><b>ESI-SB-01-0036 Installation Instructions (PDF).</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
